528,5529,5530,5531,5532,5533,5534,5535,5536,5537,5538,5539,5540,5541,5542,5543,5544,5545,5546,5547,5548,5549,5550,5551,5552,5553,5554,5555,5556,5557,5558,5559,5560,5561,5562,5563,5564,5565,5566,5567,5568,5569,5570,5571,5572,5573,5574,5575]},"attribution":{"annotator":"裴松之","attribution_kind":"quoted_comment","source_label":"徐眾評","attribution_marker":"徐众评曰","reading":"注以「徐众评曰」轉錄另一家。"},"attachment":{"received_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete:line042","received_codepoint":470,"note_ordinal":2,"source_ordinal":2},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-052","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-guyong-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-quancong:line032-pei01-01","text":"徐众评曰：礼，子事父无私财，又不敢私施，所以避尊上也。弃命专财而以邀名，未尽父子之礼。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-quancong:line032-pei01-01:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"徐众","kind":"person","person_id":"wod_cwr_976","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":32,"last_line":32,"revision_id":2120830,"raw_start":2582,"raw_end":2625,"character_positions":[2582,2583,2584,2585,2586,2587,2588,2589,2590,2591,2592,2593,2594,2595,2596,2597,2598,2599,2600,2601,2602,2603,2604,2605,2606,2607,2608,2609,2610,2611,2612,2613,2614,2615,2616,2617,2618,2619,2620,2621,2622,2623,2624]},"attribution":{"annotator":"裴松之","attribution_kind":"quoted_author","source_label":"徐眾評","attribution_marker":"徐众评曰："},"attachment":{"received_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-quancong:line032","received_codepoint":174,"note_ordinal":1,"source_ordinal":1},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-060-quancong","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-060","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-060-quancong"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01","text":"徐众评曰：牧蹈长者之规。问者曰：“如牧所行，犯而不校，又从而救之，直而不有，又还而不受，可不谓之仁让乎哉？”答曰：“异乎吾所闻。原宪之问於孔子曰：‘克伐怨欲不行焉，可以为仁乎？’孔子曰：‘可以为难矣，仁则吾不知也。’‘恶不仁者，其为仁矣。’今小民不展四体，而认人之稻，不仁甚矣，而牧推而与之，又救其罪，斯为让非其义，所救非人，非所谓恶不仁者。苟不恶不仁，安得为仁哉！苍梧浇娶妻而美，让於其兄；尾生笃信，水至不去而死；直躬好直，证父攘羊；申鸣奉法，尽忠於君而执其父。忠信直让，此四行者，圣贤之所贵也。然不贵苍梧之让，非让道也；不取尾生之信，非信所也；不许直躬之直，非直体也；不嘉申鸣之忠，非忠意也。今牧犯而不校，还而不取，可以为难矣，未得为仁让也。夫圣人以德报德，以直报怨，而牧欲以德报怨，非也。必不得已，二者何从？吾从孔子也。”","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"徐众","kind":"person","person_id":"wod_cwr_976","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"原宪","kind":"person","person_id":"b26_2bj_z9b","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0140","start":140,"end":141,"surface":"牧","kind":"person","person_id":"2ue_nmk_m3s_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"苍梧浇","kind":"person","person_id":"tcx_5ia_phu","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-060-zhonglimu:line093-pei03-01:m0196","